          <h3 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-center mb-6">Introduction</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            This page provides audio examples corresponding to the experiments described in our paper
            "MagTapeDB: A Dataset of Historical Magnetic Tape Recordings". You will find degraded and restored
            audio excerpts for piano and bandoneon, including analog tape hiss and gramophone noise. These examples
            complement objective evaluation with perceptual insight into restoration quality.
          </p>
